# Deskbar (deskbar(4), D114): the menu (Find, the Recent lists, the
# launcher's apps and preference apps, through its `apps` and `ctl`), the
# running apps (Radharc's window list), the gauges (proc's /proc/cpu and
# Radharc's pacing) and the clock's place, which Radharc draws in.
service deskbar
program deskbar
export
launcher
use windows
use notices optional
mount /data fs/volume
mount /proc proc
mount /mnt/plumb plumber
mount /lib/fonts bootfs/lib/fonts
restart on-failure
